Text:
A skeleton of FolderShapesDesign: only the grammar that the designs of this folder use.

Grammar:
ValidSegment ::= [a-z_][a-z0-9_]{0,190}                    \
               | [a-z_][a-z0-9_]{0,190}, ".", OSExtension   \
               | [a-z_][a-z0-9_]{0,190}, ".", MultiExtension
MultiExtension ::= "css.map" | "d.ts" | "d.ts.map" | "js.map" | "min.css" | "min.js" | "tar.bz2" | "tar.gz" | "tar.lz" | "tar.lz4" | "tar.xz" | "tar.zst"
ReservedName ::= con | prn | aux | nul | conin$ | conout$ | com[1-9] | lpt[1-9] | com[¹²³] | lpt[¹²³]
OSExtension ::= [a-z0-9]{1,16}

Well formedness:
in ValidSegment: the characters before the first dot do not form a ReservedName.
